是一种应法，但由于子力定位边路，变化较少且反弹力不强，所以黑方多走马2进3。","text":"红平仕角炮是顺炮直车对横车布局中较为稳健的选择，黑上右边马虽是一种应法，但由于子力定位边路，变化较少且反弹力不强，所以黑方多走马2进3。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":8,"anchor_node_id":"0:8","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment19:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment19","raw_text":"红方右马盘河，由此对黑阵展开冲击。","text":"红方右马盘河，由此对黑阵展开冲击。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":19,"anchor_node_id":"0:19","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment24:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment24","raw_text":"黑卸中炮正着，如改走炮2平4，则车八进九，马1退2，前马进五，象3进5，炮六进五，士5进4，车二进七，车3平4，马六退七，马7退5，炮五进四，红方占优。","text":"黑卸中炮正着，如改走炮2平4，则车八进九，马1退2，前马进五，象3进5，炮六进五，士5进4，车二进七，车3平4，马六退七，马7退5，炮五进四，红方占优。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":24,"anchor_node_id":"0:24","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment28:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment28","raw_text":"此时形势，红马跳至将口，为其它子力投入进攻铺平道路。实战黑接走炮2退2构成速溃，应改走炮4进5，以下车八进七，炮4退7，车八平三，象3进5，红虽占先，但黑尚可坚持。","text":"此时形势，红马跳至将口，为其它子力投入进攻铺平道路。实战黑接走炮2退2构成速溃，应改走炮4进5，以下车八进七，炮4退7，车八平三，象3进5，红虽占先，但黑尚可坚持。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":28,"anchor_node_id":"0:28","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment33:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment33","raw_text":"红弃马搏象，使黑底线暴露，为杀王创造条件，着法积极凶狠。","text":"红弃马搏象，使黑底线暴露，为杀王创造条件，着法积极凶狠。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":33,"anchor_node_id":"0:33","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment37:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment37","raw_text":"黑为化解底车危险，平炮设伏，被红机智的化解。","text":"黑为化解底车危险，平炮设伏，被红机智的化解。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":37,"anchor_node_id":"0:37","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment42:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment42","raw_text":"跟炮无奈，如象5退7，则炮一进三，黑势亦溃。","text":"跟炮无奈，如象5退7，则炮一进三，黑势亦溃。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":42,"anchor_node_id":"0:42","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment45:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment45","raw_text":"红胜。","text":"红胜。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":45,"anchor_node_id":"0:45","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["058广东邓颂宏 先胜 甘肃李家华"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第二章 顺手炮、列手炮(32局)"],"DhtmlXQ_open":["D25 顺炮直车对横车"],"DhtmlXQ_remark":[""],"DhtmlXQ_author":[""],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":16,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":1,"structured_branches":0,"line_statuses":{"legal":1},"source_move_records":45,"legal_move_records":45,"annotations":8,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":8}},"memberships":[{"book_id":"yl-book-66","category_id":"66","title":"第二章 顺手炮、列手炮 广东邓颂宏 先胜 甘肃李家华","catalogue_order":58,"directory_url":"https://m.xiangqiqipu.com/Category/List-66-3.html"}],"book_ids":["yl-book-66"]}}
